Description: Provides utility functions for processing BibTeX entries,
    extracting and cleaning bibliographic metadata, handling personal
    and institutional authors, generating short and full citations,
    and converting bibliographic records into structured tabular data.
    Supports reproducible research and automated bibliographic workflows.
